  "precisionNote": "Hand spot-check of 20 random matched complaints received before the recall (seed 1): 18 of 20 clearly describe engine seizure or catastrophic engine failure (seized, thrown rod, rod-bearing failure, engine replaced after stall); 2 were ambiguous (intermittent power loss with clicking; oil use with ticking). Observed precision about 90%. Several narratives report a dealer blaming sludge or maintenance; these were counted as engine failures because the owner describes the failure itself. Regex classification only; no labels applied.",
  "patterns": [
